{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09514","headline":"虹县严孝子墓 · 刘湾","name":"虹县严孝子墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至性教不及，因心天所资。\n礼闻三年丧，尔独终身期。\n下由骨肉恩，上报父母慈。\n礼闻哭有卒，汝独哀无时。\n前有松柏林，荆蓁结朦胧。\n墓门白日闭，泣血黄泉中。\n草服蔽枯骨，垢容戴飞蓬。\n举声哭苍天，万木皆悲风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09514.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09514","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}